[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31800800_03_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31800800_03_0010","text":"……红灯啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31800800_03_0015","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31800800_03_0020","text":"──……到了？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31800800_03_0030","text":"不，只是等红灯而已"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31800800_03_0035","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31800800_03_0040","text":"…………哦"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31800800_03_0045","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31800800_03_0050","text":"本来只是想轻轻闭一下眼睛的……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31800800_03_0060","text":"喂，冬优子……\n要不要去绕个路？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31800800_03_0070","text":"诶？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31800800_03_0080","text":"现在还有点时间\n难得的机会，觉得怎么样"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31800800_03_0090","text":"…………绕路啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31800800_03_0100","text":"其实前面有一家我推荐的店\n挺有名气的……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31800800_03_0110","text":"看你好像有点累了\n想着多少能让你散散心"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31800800_03_0120","text":"…………嗯\n那就走吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31800800_03_0130","text":"你说得没错，累倒确实不假\n难得的好意，我就领情了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31800800_03_0140","text":"好，就这么定了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31800800_03_0150","text":"可要请我吃\n最美味的东西哦"}]
